{
  "id": "draft.dialogue.mikoto.second",
  "kind": "dialogue",
  "title": "她说想看测试",
  "status": "approved",
  "version": 1,
  "rootId": "draft.dialogue.mikoto.second",
  "payload": {
    "id": "dialogue.mikoto.second",
    "idolId": "mikoto",
    "startNodeId": "1",
    "nodes": {
      "1": {
        "id": "1",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "──这里就是练习室。",
        "nextNodeId": "2"
      },
      "2": {
        "id": "2",
        "speakerId": "mikoto",
        "text": "……宽敞。",
        "nextNodeId": "3"
      },
      "3": {
        "id": "3",
        "speakerId": "mikoto",
        "text": "镜子也大。",
        "nextNodeId": "4"
      },
      "4": {
        "id": "4",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "先让我看看你平时怎么练，可以吗？",
        "nextNodeId": "5"
      },
      "5": {
        "id": "5",
        "speakerId": "mikoto",
        "text": "……嗯。",
        "nextNodeId": "6"
      },
      "6": {
        "id": "6",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "（──她一开始动，房间里的空气就变了。）",
        "nextNodeId": "7"
      },
      "7": {
        "id": "7",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "（每一个动作都干净，没有多余的地方。……这不是练过的程度。）",
        "nextNodeId": "8"
      },
      "8": {
        "id": "8",
        "speakerId": "mikoto",
        "text": "…………",
        "nextNodeId": "9"
      },
      "9": {
        "id": "9",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "（歌唱也一样。她不是在展示，是在确认。）",
        "nextNodeId": "10"
      },
      "10": {
        "id": "10",
        "speakerId": "mikoto",
        "text": "……怎么样？",
        "nextNodeId": "11"
      },
      "11": {
        "id": "11",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "…………我说实话。",
        "nextNodeId": "12"
      },
      "12": {
        "id": "12",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "我没什么能教你的。",
        "nextNodeId": "13"
      },
      "13": {
        "id": "13",
        "speakerId": "mikoto",
        "text": "……这样啊。",
        "nextNodeId": "14"
      },
      "14": {
        "id": "14",
        "speakerId": "mikoto",
        "text": "那，测试呢？我合格吗？",
        "nextNodeId": "15"
      },
      "15": {
        "id": "15",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "────",
        "nextNodeId": "16"
      },
      "16": {
        "id": "16",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "……合格。请多指教，美琴。",
        "nextNodeId": "17"
      },
      "17": {
        "id": "17",
        "speakerId": "mikoto",
        "text": "……ありがとう。",
        "nextNodeId": "18"
      },
      "18": {
        "id": "18",
        "speakerId": "mikoto",
        "text": "────呐。",
        "nextNodeId": "19"
      },
      "19": {
        "id": "19",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "嗯？",
        "nextNodeId": "20"
      },
      "20": {
        "id": "20",
        "speakerId": "mikoto",
        "text": "我，十年了。",
        "nextNodeId": "21"
      },
      "21": {
        "id": "21",
        "speakerId": "mikoto",
        "text": "一直，是这样练过来的。",
        "nextNodeId": "22"
      },
      "22": {
        "id": "22",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "……嗯。",
        "nextNodeId": "23"
      },
      "23": {
        "id": "23",
        "speakerId": "mikoto",
        "text": "所以，如果我在这里也做不到的话──",
        "nextNodeId": "24"
      },
      "24": {
        "id": "24",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "────美琴。",
        "nextNodeId": "25"
      },
      "25": {
        "id": "25",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "我不能保证你能变成什么样。",
        "nextNodeId": "26"
      },
      "26": {
        "id": "26",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "但是，我会一直看着。看你能不能站上你想站的地方。",
        "nextNodeId": "27"
      },
      "27": {
        "id": "27",
        "speakerId": "mikoto",
        "text": "………………",
        "nextNodeId": "28"
      },
      "28": {
        "id": "28",
        "speakerId": "mikoto",
        "text": "……那样的话，好像可以。",
        "nextNodeId": "29"
      },
      "29": {
        "id": "29",
        "speakerId": "mikoto",
        "text": "──请多指教。"
      }
    }
  },
